            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Eydie Oberbeck"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I eliminated the onion because my daughter doesn't like them. It was very thick. Needs acidity. I added salt and pepper. Will add vinegar and maybe some lemon juice next time. It still tasted fresh but just too thick. Put it on top of sliced Portuguese bread. Yum.",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-04T21:40:10.710Z"
          },
          {
