            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maggie Tidwell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Horseradish, my friends...about a 1/2 teaspoon. And 1/2 tsp. of cayenne and a couple dashes of tobasco. That'll give it the kick it needs. People were scooping it up with big hunks of bread when I zipped it up a bit!",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-06T17:03:03.283Z"
